    <Title>Towards how to hang a painting upside down on purpose</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0286","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2021-11-07</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0286","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ingrid Vasquez talks about the long argument with the colour blue. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</Description>
